WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:08.328
Hi!

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.289
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.328 --> 00:00:10.861
Welcome to 'What to Say'!

00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:34.250
Do you know what to say when you give advice?

00:00:34.485 --> 00:00:37.789
Listen out for useful language for giving advice.

00:00:37.821 --> 00:00:40.523
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.125
after this.

00:00:43.194 --> 00:00:44.343
Argh,

00:00:45.023 --> 00:00:47.186
 this is just ridiculous!

00:00:47.362 --> 00:00:48.362
Susan again?

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:50.382
Yeah, Susan.

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:55.898
She just keeps emailing me about things that have nothing to do with work

00:00:55.992 --> 00:00:57.725
and nothing to do with me.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.155
What do you think I should do?

00:00:59.218 --> 00:01:03.819
Well, if I were you, I'd email and ask her to stop sending them.

00:01:04.046 --> 00:01:06.366
I'm not sure that's a good idea.

00:01:07.156 --> 00:01:11.957
 I have to be careful what I say as she's quite an important client.

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:14.144
Erm, I'm not sure then.

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:17.449
Perhaps you could try talking to Yuna about it?

00:01:18.207 --> 00:01:21.070
Er ... why don't you try

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.945
doing nothing?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.633
Sorry?

00:01:24.727 --> 00:01:26.000
Perhaps you could just …

00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:29.000
do nothing?

00:01:29.391 --> 00:01:30.266
Really?

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:32.297
I'm not too sure about that.

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:36.608
Well, I remember this guy I used to work with,

00:01:36.999 --> 00:01:37.999
Mark,

00:01:38.616 --> 00:01:43.938
and he kept emailing again and again and again,

00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:47.931
about all sorts, mostly unrelated to work.

00:01:48.237 --> 00:01:51.642
Well, I kept responding politely

00:01:51.994 --> 00:01:53.661
and he kept sending them.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:57.527
 In the end, I stopped replying to his emails

00:01:57.746 --> 00:02:00.590
unless they were only about work.

00:02:00.629 --> 00:02:01.829
And what happened?

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:03.465
He stopped sending them.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.020
It's ...

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.367
It's a bit like being faced with a dangerous snake.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.805
If you move quickly, it'll bite you,

00:02:14.063 --> 00:02:17.578
but if you keep very still

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.430
and do nothing,

00:02:19.727 --> 00:02:23.152
eventually it'll move away and leave you alone.

00:02:24.457 --> 00:02:27.363
I had to learn the hard way.

00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:47.154
Hey, Bob. Have you got a minute?

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:47.928
Yeah.

00:02:48.162 --> 00:02:50.889
So, I tried what you suggested

00:02:50.905 --> 00:02:55.568
and I only responded to Susan's emails about work for a few days.

00:02:56.038 --> 00:02:57.014
Then guess what?

00:02:57.233 --> 00:02:59.541
The irrelevant emails stopped.

00:02:59.752 --> 00:03:03.541
Yes! Now she only sends me work-related ones.

00:03:03.596 --> 00:03:05.343
Well, that's very good news.

00:03:05.831 --> 00:03:07.158
All thanks to you, Bob.

00:03:07.284 --> 00:03:09.494
Any time, Noelia, any time!

00:03:11.413 --> 00:03:13.155
All in a day's work.

00:03:13.195 --> 00:03:14.022
Ahh!

00:03:19.359 --> 00:03:20.359
Hello again!

00:03:20.679 --> 00:03:23.524
It looks like Bob is in Noelia's good books.

00:03:23.852 --> 00:03:28.321
So, did you notice the useful phrases used for giving advice?

00:03:28.391 --> 00:03:30.325
Listen to me and then repeat.

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:32.180
What do you think I should do?

00:03:34.704 --> 00:03:36.285
What do you think I should do?

00:03:38.465 --> 00:03:40.160
If I were you, I'd ask her.

00:03:42.715 --> 00:03:44.434
If I were you, I'd ask her.

00:03:47.067 --> 00:03:49.200
I'm not sure that's a good idea.

00:03:52.233 --> 00:03:54.264
I'm not sure that's a good idea.

00:03:56.616 --> 00:03:58.936
Perhaps you could try talking to Yuna.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.660
Perhaps you could try talking to Yuna.

00:04:08.012 --> 00:04:09.879
Why don't you try doing nothing?

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.521
Why don't you try doing nothing?

00:04:17.232 --> 00:04:18.982
I'm not too sure about that.

00:04:21.936 --> 00:04:23.802
I'm not too sure about that.

00:04:26.717 --> 00:04:28.517
I tried what you suggested.

00:04:31.521 --> 00:04:33.321
I tried what you suggested.

00:04:36.006 --> 00:04:40.835
Try and use some of these phrases the next time you give advice in English.

00:04:41.055 --> 00:04:42.632
Bye for now!

